+Black is selected from an explicit `tool.black` section in `pyproject.toml` or a single supported official Black hook in `.pre-commit-config.yaml`. Ruff lint configuration alone does not override that selection; explicit Ruff formatting configuration takes precedence over a Black TOML section.
